wrapper of the interface method `sync.Locker.Lock` (`<autogenerated>`), an interface call.

`checkG9` rejects it (`v11 = CALLinter v10 v8 v1`); `checkG10` accepts it with the PC table `tab`
and the class table `kt`. Block `b1`: `v14 = ArgIntReg` (`R0`, the itab), `v15 = ArgIntReg`
