pointer), `v8 = Copy v15` (`R0`), `v11 = CALLinter v10 v8 v1` (no result), `v12 = SelectN v11`
(its memory), `v13 = MakeResult v12`; `Ret`. Its Progs: `MOVD 24(R0), R2`, `MOVD R1, R0`,
`CALL (R2)`, `RET`.

By compiled evaluation (`native_decide`, listed in `scripts/axioms-allowlist.txt`; `g10_facts`),
