`0x10000 + 4·ID`, `ret = 0`) and a callee hook `GenG2.H0` that returns to `X30` (which satisfies
`ICallOK` at the address `2^40` in `X2`: `icallOKc`), `g10_value` twice gives a machine run of the
Progs through `CALL (R2)` and the hook to a state related before `v13` (`genG10_value_witness`).
